page='''<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Four deferred geometry decisions</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;color:#263744;margin:25px}p{max-width:1250px;line-height:1.5}select,button,textarea{font:inherit;padding:8px;margin:5px}textarea{width:95%;height:80px}.box{border-left:4px solid #087f8c;padding:5px 18px;background:#f4f8f9}table{border-collapse:collapse}td,th{padding:7px;border:1px solid #ddd}#map{min-width:1000px}#wrap{overflow-x:auto}</style><h1>Geometry review: four deferred cases</h1><p>Original reference, current collapse and recommended outcome are visible together. Orange = investigated reaches; reference teal = originally selected reaches; grey = context. Gold markers = required boundaries. Other labelled markers are context, not additional boundaries. Hover a reach for its ID, direction and length.</p><p>Start with <b>Detail</b>, then use <b>Overview</b> and the case-specific views. Zoom/pan each panel independently; preset buttons reset all three to the same extent. For direction and scope decisions, the recommended geometry is intentionally unchanged. No unbuilt alternative is shown as though it exists.</p><select id="pick" onchange="show()"></select><span id="status"></span><h2 id="title"></h2><div class="box"><p id="explanation"></p><p id="constraint"></p></div><div id="views"></div><div id="wrap"><div id="map"></div></div><p><b>Recommended action:</b> <span id="action"></span></p><p><b>Alternative:</b> <span id="alternative"></span></p><details><summary>Highlighted directed reaches and lengths</summary><div id="table"></div></details><h3>Decision after seeing geometry</h3><select id="decision" onchange="save()"><option>Defer / exclude case for now</option><option>Accept recommended fix for isolated testing</option><option>Prefer stated alternative</option><option>Revise proposal — see notes</option></select><br><textarea id="notes" oninput="save()" placeholder="Decision conditions or remaining questions"></textarea><p><button onclick="download()">Export updated decisions — all 27 cases</button><span id="saveStatus"></span></p><p>The 23 previously accepted entries are retained unchanged in the export. These four remain deferred until you choose otherwise. Approval is for isolated testing; production changes remain unauthorised.</p><script>__PLOTLY__</script><script>const cases=__DATA__;const original=__ORIGINAL__;const key='river-four-geometry-decisions-20261027';let reviews={};try{reviews=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)||'{}')}catch(e){}const el=id=>document.getElementById(id);const pick=el('pick');cases.forEach((c,i)=>pick.add(new Option(c.key,i)));function esc(v){return String(v??'').replaceAll('&','&amp;').replaceAll('<','&lt;').replaceAll('>','&gt;')}function view(name){const r=cases[+pick.value].views[name];let update={};for(let i=1;i<=3;i++){let s=i===1?'':i;update['xaxis'+s+'.range']=r[0];update['yaxis'+s+'.range']=r[1]}Plotly.relayout('map',update)}function show(){const c=cases[+pick.value];for(const k of ['title','explanation','constraint','action','alternative'])el(k).textContent=c[k];el('title').textContent=c.key+' — '+c.title;Plotly.react('map',c.figure.data,c.figure.layout,{responsive:true,scrollZoom:true});el('views').replaceChildren();Object.keys(c.views).forEach(v=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=v.replaceAll('_',' ');b.onclick=()=>view(v);el('views').appendChild(b)});let cols=['panel','link','upstream','downstream','length_m'];el('table').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+cols.map(k=>'<th>'+k+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+c.evidence.map(r=>'<tr>'+cols.map(k=>'<td>'+esc(r[k])+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';el('decision').value=reviews[c.key]?.decision||'Defer / exclude case for now';el('notes').value=reviews[c.key]?.notes??c.previous_notes;el('status').textContent=(+pick.value+1)+' / 4'}function save(){let c=cases[+pick.value];reviews[c.key]={decision:el('decision').value,notes:el('notes').value};try{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(reviews));el('saveStatus').textContent='Saved in this browser.'}catch(e){el('saveStatus').textContent='Export to preserve decisions.'}}function download(){const data=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(original));for(const c of data.cases)if(reviews[c.key])Object.assign(c,reviews[c.key]);data.geometry_review='four_deferred_20261027';const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(data,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));a.download='boundary-fix-decisions-after-geometry.json';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href)}show();</script>'''
